  <NAME>Homo sapiens</NAME>
  <TITLE>Gene Expression Profile of 57 human T-ALL samples collected in human clinical trial E2993 (Marks et al., 2009)</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>Analysis of microarray gene expression signatures in adult T-ALL demonstrated a high prevalence of early immature leukemias and revealed a close relationship between these tumors and myeloid leukemias. Overall design: 57 adult T-ALL samples were analyzed</DESCRIPTION>
